# Debian 13 CIS remediation control switches
#
# Policy source only: the current remediation role does not yet read these
# switches. Wire the role to this file before relying on them for execution.
#
# false = do not run remediation for the control (safe default)
# true  = approve remediation for the control
#
# Review every change with the relevant system/application owner before
# changing false to true. This file contains no credentials.

